                                          "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                          "args": {
                                            "text": [
                                              "Pip reads his\nsmaller speech: We\nwill visit these\nstops, record what\nfails, and tell",
                                              "people the truth.\nMoxie signs it.\nDot signs as\nwitness. Nib says\nit lacks sparkle,",
                                              "then asks for a\ncopy to hang in\nthe lodge."
                                            ],
