                                                "args": {
                                                  "text": [
                                                    "Moxie signs: Stops\nare named, signal\ncards posted,\nbackup copies\nready. If I miss a",
                                                    "handoff, Pip gets\nthe truth. She\nadds that the sled\nrunner now turns\nwithout editorial",
                                                    "comment, then\ncrosses out now to\navoid tempting\nfate."
